  "implementation": [
    "Actual receiver request/plan and idle transmitter inputs admit against the canonical target budget on the Open worker, while retaining isolated candidate Contexts.",
    "All concrete scientific target roots and idle state validate before publication. Expected canonical key checks again under the application lock; accepted owner stays locked across that final readiness operation.",
    "Only after successful readiness, swap accepted inputs, stamp the genuine detached receiver key, clear target result/performance and original paths, and publish prepared transfer. Foreign/stale/admission rejection preserves target state and pending models.",
    "GUI take/attachment reuses target reservations and the committed generation. Same-budget preview transfer aliases the exact guard; no extra science, reservation or revision advance.",
    "Successful ordinary Apply/New clears old unconsumed prepared models; rejected edits retain them. Genuine old execution leases remain active through cancellation until known terminal.",
    "Legacy request rebind helpers are test-only compatibility paths after production Open moves to the target-prepared path. No public scientific API, numerical algorithm, schema, binding, dependency or CXX/QML registration change."
  ],
